[["le quotidien","m","日常；日报","everyday life; daily paper","der Alltag; die Tageszeitung","Le français fait partie de mon quotidien.","法语是我日常生活的一部分。","French is part of my everyday life."],["l'emploi","m","工作；就业","job; employment","die Stelle; die Beschäftigung","Elle cherche un emploi à Lyon.","她在里昂找工作。","She's looking for a job in Lyon."],["le salaire","m","工资","salary; wage","das Gehalt","Le salaire minimum a augmenté.","最低工资上涨了。","The minimum wage has gone up."],["la réunion","f","会议","meeting","die Besprechung","La réunion a duré deux heures.","会议开了两个小时。","The meeting lasted two hours."],["l'avis","m","意见","opinion","die Meinung","À mon avis, c'est une bonne idée.","我认为这是个好主意。","In my opinion, it's a good idea."],["le sujet","m","话题；主题","subject; topic","das Thema","C'est un sujet délicat.","这是个敏感话题。","It's a sensitive topic."],["l'environnement","m","环境","environment","die Umwelt","Il faut protéger l'environnement.","必须保护环境。","We must protect the environment."],["la société","f","社会；公司","society; company","die Gesellschaft; die Firma","La société change très vite.","社会变化很快。","Society is changing very fast."],["le gouvernement","m","政府","government","die Regierung","Le gouvernement a présenté son budget.","政府公布了预算。","The government presented its budget."],["l'élection","f","选举","election","die Wahl","L'élection aura lieu en juin.","选举将在六月举行。","The election will take place in June."],["l'orchestre","m","管弦乐队","orchestra","das Orchester","L'orchestre joue du Debussy ce soir.","乐团今晚演奏德彪西。","The orchestra is playing Debussy tonight."],["le chanteur","m","歌手","singer","der Sänger","Ce chanteur vient du Québec.","这位歌手来自魁北克。","This singer comes from Quebec."],["l'album","m","专辑","album","das Album","Son nouvel album sort vendredi.","她的新专辑周五发行。","Her new album comes out on Friday."],["la pensée","f","思想；想法","thought; thinking","der Gedanke; das Denken","La pensée de Camus est très actuelle.","加缪的思想至今仍有现实意义。","Camus's thought is still very relevant."],["la liberté","f","自由","freedom","die Freiheit","La liberté d'expression est essentielle.","言论自由至关重要。","Freedom of expression is essential."],["réussir","v","成功；通过","to succeed; to pass","schaffen; bestehen","Elle a réussi son examen.","她通过了考试。","She passed her exam."],["se rendre compte","v","意识到","to realise","merken; sich bewusst werden","Je me suis rendu compte de mon erreur.","我意识到了自己的错误。","I realised my mistake."],["profiter de","v","利用；享受","to make the most of; to enjoy","genießen; nutzen","Profite bien de tes vacances !","好好享受假期！","Enjoy your holidays!"],["choisir","v","选择","to choose","wählen","Il est difficile de choisir.","很难选择。","It's hard to choose."],["expliquer","v","解释","to explain","erklären","Peux-tu m'expliquer cette règle ?","你能给我解释一下这条规则吗？","Can you explain this rule to me?"],["améliorer","v","改善","to improve","verbessern","Je veux améliorer mon accent.","我想改善我的口音。","I want to improve my accent."],["éviter","v","避免","to avoid","vermeiden","J'évite les supermarchés le samedi.","我周六避开超市。","I avoid supermarkets on Saturdays."],["se plaindre","v","抱怨","to complain","sich beschweren","Il se plaint toujours du bruit.","他总是抱怨噪音。","He always complains about the noise."],["économiser","v","节省","to save","sparen","On économise pour un voyage.","我们在为旅行攒钱。","We're saving for a trip."],["participer à","v","参加","to take part in","teilnehmen an","Elle participe à une manifestation.","她参加了一场游行。","She's taking part in a demonstration."],["croire","v","相信；认为","to believe; to think","glauben","Je crois qu'il a raison.","我认为他是对的。","I think he's right."],["valoir la peine","expr","值得","to be worth it","sich lohnen","Ce livre vaut vraiment la peine.","这本书真的值得一读。","This book is really worth it."],["avoir envie de","expr","想要","to feel like","Lust haben auf","J'ai envie d'écouter du jazz.","我想听爵士乐。","I feel like listening to jazz."],["disponible","adj","有空的；可用的","available","verfügbar","Le document est disponible en ligne.","文件可以在线获取。","The document is available online."],["responsable","adj","负责的","responsible","verantwortlich","Qui est responsable du projet ?","谁负责这个项目？","Who is responsible for the project?"],["étranger","adj","外国的","foreign","ausländisch; fremd","Elle parle trois langues étrangères.","她会说三门外语。","She speaks three foreign languages."],["fier","adj","自豪的","proud","stolz","Je suis fière de toi.","我为你骄傲。","I'm proud of you."],["actuel","adj","当前的","current; present-day","aktuell","La situation actuelle est inquiétante.","当前形势令人担忧。","The current situation is worrying."],["d'ailleurs","adv","再说；顺便说","besides; by the way","übrigens","D'ailleurs, il ne m'a jamais répondu.","再说，他从没回复我。","Besides, he never answered me."],["pourtant","adv","然而","yet; however","trotzdem; dennoch","Il est riche, pourtant il n'est pas heureux.","他很富有，可并不快乐。","He's rich, yet he isn't happy."],["donc","conj","所以","so; therefore","also","Je pense, donc je suis.","我思故我在。","I think, therefore I am."],["bien que","conj","尽管","although","obwohl","Bien qu'il pleuve, on sort.","尽管下雨，我们还是出去。","Although it's raining, we're going out."],["pendant que","conj","当……时","while","während","Il lit pendant que je cuisine.","我做饭时他在看书。","He reads while I cook."],["grâce à","prep","多亏","thanks to","dank","Grâce à toi, j'ai trouvé un appartement.","多亏你，我找到了公寓。","Thanks to you, I found a flat."],["à cause de","prep","因为（不好的原因）","because of","wegen","Le vol est annulé à cause de la grève.","航班因罢工取消了。","The flight is cancelled because of the strike."]]